# Requests the maintainer's review on pull requests that someone else opens,
# Dependabot included (#269). A draft pull request gets the request when it
# is marked ready for review, not when it opens. GitHub never requests a
# review from a pull request's own author, so the maintainer's own pull
# requests do not change.
#
# Review is requested, not required: main has no branch protection or
# ruleset that requires code owner approval. Adding that rule would block
# the maintainer from merging their own pull requests.
